OL,5,G2100 The Blues Show with Cerys Matthews
OL,6,     FUK blues singer, songwriter and
OL,7,     Fguitarist Oli Mac, also known as
OL,8,     FMississippi MacDonald, joins Cerys
OL,9,     Fto chat about his career and to
OL,10,     Fpick some of his favourite blues
OL,11,     Fsongs.
OL,12,G2200 The Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,13,     FFeelgood tunes to groove and
OL,14,     Fsoothe your soul. Dr Beat is also
OL,15,     Fon hand to prescribe a perfect
OL,16,     Ftune for a listener whose week
OL,17,     Fhasn't got off to the best start!
