OL,5,G0000 OJ Borg
OL,6,     FOJ is live through the night from
OL,7,     Fa chilly Salford Riviera with your
OL,8,     Fcold hard facts. Plus, Midnight
OL,9,     FMastermind, Wish You Were There
OL,10,     Fand the first Midnight Caller of
OL,11,     Fthe week.
OL,12,G0230 One Hit Wonders with OJ Borg
OL,13,     FOJ's celebrating 37 years since
OL,14,     Fthe release of Got To Get, the
OL,15,     Fonly hit from Rob 'N' Raz, where
OL,16,     Fyou'll also hear how the track
OL,17,     Fcame about. Plus, more from 1989.
